@* Holds whatever the current page puts in the top bar.

   Carries its own render mode for the same reason ThemeToggle and UserMenu do: a layout does not
   inherit a page's. It matters more here than there, though — the pages that fill this slot put
   *buttons* in it (Run, Save, the assistant), and a section outlet only receives content from the
   renderer it lives in. Rendered statically, this slot shows the buttons and none of them work. *@

@rendermode InteractiveServer

<SectionOutlet SectionName="topbar" />
